\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Execution timeline of a single simulated day for both teams (CFA, value-based zone selection, seed~1, day~1), reconstructed from the actual simulation log. Both teams start their routine route at 8:00; disruptions (Type~1 and Type~2) are inserted mid-route via cheapest insertion, and the shared 60-minute lunch break is fixed at 12:00--13:00 and interrupts the active service stop if one is ongoing. Of the 20 routine tasks planned for the day, 10 could not be completed and were carried over to day~2.\relax }}{37}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:example_day_gantt}{{5}{37}{Execution timeline of a single simulated day for both teams (CFA, value-based zone selection, seed~1, day~1), reconstructed from the actual simulation log. Both teams start their routine route at 8:00; disruptions (Type~1 and Type~2) are inserted mid-route via cheapest insertion, and the shared 60-minute lunch break is fixed at 12:00--13:00 and interrupts the active service stop if one is ongoing. Of the 20 routine tasks planned for the day, 10 could not be completed and were carried over to day~2.\relax }{figure.caption.5}{}}
